{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The portion of a day in its day.</b> The amount needed for a day's eating they would gather on its day — and not today for the need of tomorrow (Mekhilta)." "<b>That I may test them, whether they will walk in My Torah.</b> Whether they will keep the commandments dependent on it — that they leave none over from it, and that they not go out on the Sabbath to gather."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:36.557069313Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}